{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Puttler is a mini-golf puzzle game featuring wacky obstacles and a charming backstory.</i><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198680/extras/Sequence_01.gif?t=1744927610\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198680/extras/SteamStoreText.png?t=1744927610\" /><strong> </strong> <br><strong>The Puttler World Tour has officially begun, and your journey to becoming a professional Puttler starts now! Compete in 12 colorful courses across the globe to build your reputation, earn cash, acquire new Puttlers, and customize your bag. </strong>   <br>\u00a0 <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198680/extras/Sequence_01_2.gif?t=1744927610\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198680/extras/SteamStoreText2.png?t=1744927610\" /><strong>Using physics and seven different shapes called &quot;Puttlers,&quot; your goal is to sink the golf ball in as few strokes as possible! Build creative solutions to stay under par, or craft complex contraptions to solve each puzzle. </strong>     <br> \u00a0 <br> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198680/extras/Sequence_01_1.gif?t=1744927610\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198680/extras/SteamStoreText3.png?t=1744927610\" /><strong>\u27a4 234 satisfying puzzles to solve\u00a0     </strong> <br><strong>\u27a4 campaign style progression      </strong> <br><strong>\u27a4 colorful monochromatic graphics     </strong> <br><strong>\u27a4 relaxing ambient nature sounds\u00a0       </strong> <br><strong>\u27a4 charming backstory and dialogue\u00a0       </strong> <br><strong>\u27a4 secret bonus course to unlock</strong>  <br>  <br> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198680/extras/Sequence_01_3.gif?t=1744927610\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198680/extras/SteamStoreText4.png?t=1744927610\" /><strong>\u27a4 portals\u00a0      </strong> <br><strong>\u27a4 black holes      </strong> <br><strong>\u27a4 sand pits           </strong> <br><strong>\u27a4 hatches </strong> <br><strong>\u27a4 moving platforms      </strong> <br><strong>\u27a4 fountains </strong><br> <br><strong><u>Developer Note</u></strong>  <br>Hey everyone! My name is Anderson, and I'm the creator of <i>Puttler</i>. If you're considering purchasing my game, please keep in mind that we are a very new indie studio of two friends who poured our hearts into this project. While this game isn't a AAA title with endless workshop content, we still estimate over 30 hours of content to 100% the game. <i>Puttler</i> is meant to be a relaxing and fun puzzle game, so if you end up playing, take your time, create fun solutions, and have fun!\ud83e\udd0e</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Peak Performance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3198680/54d80bbb0665d7ed39f67a2d420d2e50503246fc.jpg"},{"name":"Pine Pioneer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3198680/07e27613eeed9be94cbd62c688ca031b52eaa1d4.jpg"},{"name":"Crystal Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3198680/ef03ea7949fdc49c6a565ff9fadcabd056cfc984.jpg"},{"name":"Koali-fied","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3198680/cd0a1be0de4eb53d255a4e7f3285521768bc0811.jpg"},{"name":"Sandy Star","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3198680/08c7875b65abe4690dab21b3b99a73f3562a091f.jpg"},{"name":"Sun-Kissed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/p